  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 975448,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 0XC64 Logo: A Trio of Puzzle Challenges on the Commodore 64\n\nPrepare for a provocative and challenging puzzle experience with *0XC64 Logo* for the Commodore 64! This unique collection features three distinct games, each presenting a fresh twist on logic and spatial reasoning, interspersed with digitized female figures.\n\nThe core gameplay revolves around manipulating stone combinations within strict time limits. Game 1 tasks you with recreating patterns by strategically placing stones, managing their values which dynamically increase with each placement. Game 2 demands you erase pre-defined patterns by clicking stones, triggering chain reactions that can create new stones in unexpected places. Finally, Game 3 refines the formula, allowing you to remove only pairs of stones with matching color and value, while impacting the surrounding stones. \n\nUndoing moves is available in the first and third games, offering a lifeline against the ticking clock. Passwords unlock further levels, extending the challenge. *0XC64 Logo* offers a blend of addictive gameplay and a distinctive, albeit controversial, aesthetic, providing a memorable and perplexing experience for Commodore 64 enthusiasts."
    },
